1
00:00:00,253 --> 00:00:02,023
Welcome to week 3.

2
00:00:02,063 --> 00:00:05,845
This one's a walking practice, so stand up if you can.

3
00:00:05,885 --> 00:00:07,884
A hallway, your room,

4
00:00:07,924 --> 00:00:09,331
a path outside,

5
00:00:09,371 --> 00:00:13,142
anywhere works. Walk slower than usual.

6
00:00:13,182 --> 00:00:15,704
Feel your heel touch down,

7
00:00:15,744 --> 00:00:17,544
then the ball of your foot,

8
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:20,394
then your toes. Lift.

9
00:00:20,434 --> 00:00:22,902
Move. Place.

10
00:00:22,942 --> 00:00:25,418
Let your breath find its own rhythm.

11
00:00:25,458 --> 00:00:28,884
When your mind runs ahead of your to-do list, that's fine.

12
00:00:28,924 --> 00:00:31,192
Notice it, and come back to your feet.

13
00:00:32,208 --> 00:00:36,011
Now, here's a tool to carry with you this week.

14
00:00:36,051 --> 00:00:37,986
It's called STOP.

15
00:00:38,026 --> 00:00:42,271
And it's for the moment right before you open AI.

16
00:00:42,311 --> 00:00:45,238
S, stop. Just pause.

17
00:00:45,278 --> 00:00:46,981
T, take a breath.

18
00:00:48,062 --> 00:00:50,329
O, observe.

19
00:00:50,369 --> 00:00:51,528
What am I feeling?

20
00:00:51,568 --> 00:00:53,848
Rushed? Stuck?

21
00:00:53,888 --> 00:00:56,442
Curious?

22
00:00:56,482 --> 00:00:58,928
P, proceed, on purpose.

23
00:00:58,968 --> 00:01:00,763
Maybe that means using AI.

24
00:01:00,803 --> 00:01:03,589
Maybe it means trying it yourself first.

25
00:01:03,629 --> 00:01:05,844
Either way, it's your choice.

26
00:01:05,884 --> 00:01:09,196
Keep walking for a few more minutes,

27
00:01:09,236 --> 00:01:12,288
and try one STOP before you open AI today.
